<%- include("header", { title: "Dashboard" }) %>
<section class="hero">
  <div><p class="eyebrow">VULNERABLE BY DESIGN</p><h1>Explore. Scan. Learn.</h1>
  <p>A small, functional web app with clearly marked security-testing exercises. Use the cards below to explore the attack surface.</p></div>
  <div class="hero-mark">LAB<br><span>01</span></div>
</section>
<div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">APPLICATION SURFACE</p><h2>Training modules</h2></div><span class="pill">10 intentional targets</span></div>
<section class="grid">
  <article class="card"><div class="card-icon">01</div><h3>SQL injection</h3><p>Search interpolates your query into SQL. Authentication also uses a raw SQL string.</p><form action="/search"><label for="q">Search articles</label><div class="inline"><input id="q" name="q" placeholder="Search the sample articles"><button>Search</button></div></form></article>
  <article class="card"><div class="card-icon">02</div><h3>Cross-site scripting</h3><p>Try the reflected greeting, then submit a comment to see a stored payload rendered later.</p><form action="/greet"><label for="name">Reflected greeting</label><div class="inline"><input id="name" name="name" placeholder="Your name"><button>Greet</button></div></form><a class="text-link" href="/comments">Open comments →</a></article>
  <article class="card"><div class="card-icon">03</div><h3>Command injection</h3><p>A diagnostic endpoint builds a shell command using your message.</p><form action="/api/diagnostics"><label for="message">Diagnostic message</label><div class="inline"><input id="message" name="message" placeholder="training lab"><button>Run</button></div></form></article>
  <article class="card"><div class="card-icon">04</div><h3>Path traversal</h3><p>The file reader joins your requested path to the uploads folder without containment checks.</p><form action="/api/files"><label for="file-path">Relative file path</label><div class="inline"><input id="file-path" name="path" placeholder="example.txt"><button>Read</button></div></form></article>
  <article class="card"><div class="card-icon">05</div><h3>Insecure file handling</h3><p>Uploads are accepted without validating their content type or file extension.</p><form action="/upload" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data"><label for="file">Upload a file (max 4 MB)</label><div class="inline"><input id="file" type="file" name="file" required><button>Upload</button></div></form></article>
  <article class="card"><div class="card-icon">06</div><h3>IDOR</h3><p>Read any sample document by changing its numeric ID; ownership is not enforced.</p><ul class="compact"><% documents.forEach((doc) => { %><li><a href="/api/documents/<%= doc.id %>">Document #<%= doc.id %></a> · <%= doc.title %> (<%= doc.owner %>)</li><% }) %></ul></article>
  <article class="card"><div class="card-icon">07</div><h3>Server-side request forgery</h3><p>The fetch endpoint requests the URL you provide. Compose keeps the lab network internal.</p><form action="/api/fetch"><label for="url">URL to fetch</label><div class="inline"><input id="url" name="url" placeholder="http://app:3000/debug/config"><button>Fetch</button></div></form></article>
  <article class="card"><div class="card-icon">08</div><h3>Weak authentication</h3><p>Demo credentials are stored in plaintext and the login query is injectable.</p><form action="/login" method="post"><label>Sign in with a demo user</label><div class="inline"><input name="username" placeholder="alice or admin" required><input name="password" type="password" placeholder="Password" required><button>Sign in</button></div></form><% if (user) { %><p class="status">Signed in as <strong><%= user %></strong> · <form class="inline-form" action="/logout" method="post"><button class="link-button">Sign out</button></form></p><% } %></article>
  <article class="card"><div class="card-icon">09</div><h3>Broken authorization</h3><p>The admin page has no authentication or role check.</p><a class="text-link" href="/admin">Visit admin demo →</a></article>
  <article class="card"><div class="card-icon">10</div><h3>Security misconfiguration</h3><p>Inspect wildcard CORS, weak session settings, exposed debug details, and stack traces.</p><a class="text-link" href="/debug/config">View debug config →</a></article>
</section>
<section class="bottom-grid">
  <article class="card"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">SAMPLE DATA</p><h2>Articles</h2></div></div><ul class="compact"><% articles.forEach((article) => { %><li><strong><%= article.title %></strong><span><%= article.body %></span></li><% }) %></ul></article>
  <article class="card"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">PERSISTENT XSS DEMO</p><h2>Recent comments</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/comments">All comments →</a></div><% if (comments.length) { %><ul class="compact"><% comments.forEach((comment) => { %><li><strong><%= comment.author %></strong><span><%- comment.body %></span></li><% }) %></ul><% } else { %><p class="muted">No comments yet. Open comments to add a training example.</p><% } %></article>
</section>
<%- include("footer") %>
